  body: "<p>Each supported RID gets a <strong>NativeAOT</strong> build of the <code>flux</code> executable. One RID-neutral <strong>framework-dependent</strong> build is the fallback. Self-contained and single-file JIT builds are not published. The trim and AOT analyzers run on every build, so AOT-incompatible code fails the build instead of the release.</p>"
